OL,3,GNEWSAWeekly round-up: Five stories you
OL,4,Amay have missed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist electronic tracking
OL,7,Fequipment has helped locate what is
OL,8,Fbelieved to be the first yellow-legged
OL,9,FAsian hornet nest found on the Isle of
OL,10,FWight.
OL,12,FThe nest was located by the National
OL,13,FBee Unit (NBU) last week after an
OL,14,Finitial picture of a hornet was
OL,15,Fsubmitted on the Asian Hornet Watch app
OL,16,Fby a member of the public.
